Z||000004||DRH||01-24-2000||12:47 PM||||Baggy, welcome to the forum.<P>It is a small world. I live in Wisconsin now, but I grew up in Montevallo. I got my associates degree from Bessemer State Technical College in 1984.<P>I still have family in AL and get back there once or twice a year. Maybe I'll get a chance to meet some of you AL Fiero people one of these days.<P>||||reg||1
